    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the depths of Bog\u2019s Tower in this <strong>Deckbuilding Roguelike</strong>, where every run is randomly generated and filled with enemies that embody the struggles of the modern age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/5144bf73cb1d6d7955c861ac81c9f15e.avif?t=1753709326\" data-has-big width=800 height=187 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding Chaos</strong> \u2013 Choose your cards with care! As you embark on your journey, you'll encounter a vast array of cards to enhance your deck with each new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Packed Combat</strong> \u2013 Face off against caricatures of the modern world, each presenting unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vill you eat ze bugs?</strong>\u2013 Descend into the randomly generated depths of Lord Bog's Dungeon, encountering  events which choices will either help or hinder you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/226f69bcef2317e0acb8b610169ba8eb.poster.avif?t=1753709326\" width=800 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/226f69bcef2317e0acb8b610169ba8eb.webm?t=1753709326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coal or Gems?</strong> \u2013 Scattered throughout the extraordinary dungeon lie powerful items. These items can dramatically amplify the strength of your deck, offering game-changing synergies and interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/c92fa1f5bab5a6499f2f433f2eb62b52.avif?t=1753709326\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frens - </strong>As you journey through the depths of the dungeon, you\u2019ll encounter allies willing to join your cause\u2014each bringing unique abilities, passive buffs, or tactical advantages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to venture beneath Lord bogs Tower?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
